    "title": "Taylor Swift's Tuesday Dinner Dates Revealed: Comedian Jerrod Carmichael & His Boyfriend! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Just Jared ,\n16 hours ago Taylor Swift was spotted out for dinner on Tuesday night in New York City and now her famous dinner date has been revealed!\nThe 35-year-old singer was spotted dining with her longtime friend, comedian Jerrod Carmichael , on Tuesday night (October 7) in the Big Apple.\nJerrod ‘s boyfriend Michael was also spotted with them!\nFor those who don’t know, Jerrod starred in his own NBC sitcom The Carmichael Show from 2015 to 2017 and later came out as gay in a 2022 special for HBO. He hosted the Golden Globes in 2023 and has been spotted with Taylor in public on numerous occasions over the years.\nTaylor is currently promoting her album The Life of a Showgirl and will appear on the Seth Meyers show this evening. She just broke the record for biggest album sales week of all time!\n3",
